  "issue": 483,
  "request": "Issue #483: 629b: [BUG] Centralize normal Flow target binding with CLI-generated directives\\n\\nGoal: Make normal Flow target-sensitive actions use a CLI-generated immutable FlowTargetBinding, eliminating agent-side guard-string transcription while preserving fail-closed ACTIVE_FLOW_MISMATCH behavior.\\nScope: Flow dispatcher and next-action directives; binding validation for run ID, Issue, spec, worktree, and branch; focused unit/CLI tests; update the senti.flow skill and run senti upgrade only if the skill source changes.\\nOut of scope: Relaxing/removing target guards, automatic mutation retry after mismatch, automatic target adoption, and direct Flow/finalize-cleanup state-machine redesign.\\nAcceptance: Central binding covers normal target-sensitive actions; no agent/skill identity re-entry; resume reacquires/validates binding; mismatches stop before side effects; generated commands avoid transcription mismatch; test read-only recovery, no-Issue/multiple/missing targets, and finalize-cleanup boundaries.",
